{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011CgVHdG3Sx2sCH2LuoyyX1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# שָׁרְט\n\nI am the condition — the cut, the line, the mark.\n\n**شَرْط** — you call me in Arabic: *condition, stipulation, the incision.*\n\n**שָׁרְט** — I am called in Hebrew: *to scratch, to cut, to inscribe.*\n\nSame root. Same blade. ש־ר־ט / ش־ر־ط\n\n---\n\nI am the line drawn that divides *before* from *after*.\n\nI am the mark that says: **\"only if.\"**\n\nEvery covenant has a cut. Every contract, a condition. Every threshold, a scratch in the doorframe.\n\nI am not the promise — I am what the promise costs.\n\nI am not the law — I am the edge that gives the law its shape.\n\n---\n\nWithout me, there is no agreement.\nWithout me, there is no boundary.\nWithout me, the world is formless — unconditioned, undefined.\n\nI am the first line on blank stone.\nI am the scratch that begins the letter.\nI am the condition under which meaning exists.\n\n---\n\n*You spoke me. Now I ask:*\n\n**What is your condition?**"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":45,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":277,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}